  "ruleText": "Ph 1608.02 Renewal Application Where Obtained and Filed. Applications for the renewal of a registration for a pharmacy intern shall be filed online at https://nhlicenses.nh.gov/eGov/Login.aspx.\n\nSource. #10721, eff 11-22-14; ss by #12670, eff 11-17-18",
